# Hidden from Vercel so it sees a plain static directory and zero-configs it.
# With package.json present, Vercel detects the `build` script and runs it — but
# build.mjs needs Foundry's `cast` and the parent workspace, neither of which
# exists in a build container. generated/data.js is committed instead, and
# scripts/check-web-build.mjs proves it is not stale.
package.json
build.mjs
test/
node_modules/
